OL,3,AMayors to get powers to overrule local
OL,4,Acouncils on planning decisions
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayors across England will be given new
OL,7,Fpowers to overrule local councils on
OL,8,Fsome planning decisions.
OL,10,FThe change would apply to proposals
OL,11,Fwith more than 150 homes, more than
OL,12,F15,000 square metres of commercial
OL,13,Fspace or buildings over 30 metres.
OL,15,FMayors in 13 areas including
OL,16,FManchester, Liverpool, the West of
OL,17,FEngland and the West Midlands will gain
OL,18,Fsimilar powers to Sir Sadiq Khan in
OL,19,FLondon, who is already able to "call
OL,20,Fin" planning decisions.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
